    <h3 style="margin-top: 56px; text-align: center;">One price. Everything the app does.</h3>
    <p class="subhead" style="text-align: center;" data-animate="fade-up">No à-la-carte unlocks, no protocol paywalls, no subscription. The Mac app is <strong>$19.99</strong> — <strong>$12 early-bird for the waitlist</strong> — and includes AirPlay 1 + Sonos and the measurement-assisted room sync. New capabilities on the roadmap (Room Tuning, more protocols) ship into the app as it grows.</p>
